    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19265" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Gallius</span></b> , a, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>name of a Roman</i> gens.
